comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T18:14:04.050Z",codex-jellyfin-api-20260807,"No credentials, endpoints, live identifiers, media inventories, raw schemas, or payloads may enter Git or PM. Live checks use JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1 and retain only aggregate contract evidence."
  "2026-08-07T18:47:38.492Z",codex-jellyfin-api-20260807,"Exact contract refinement: trailer and activity sort controls now use current literal unions, serialize as repeated array query values, and reject unknown fields/orders before any network request. The official ActivityLogSortBy value is intentionally spelled Overiew because that is the published 12.0-rc4 wire enum."
  "2026-08-07T18:53:57.559Z",codex-jellyfin-api-20260807,"PM dogfood finding filed after all-state GitHub duplicate search: unbraind/pm-cli#931 documents that pm test misclassifies every unrelated node dist/cli.js executable as the pm CLI. The false execution_context mismatch did not affect the linked Jellyfin test result; the assertion and command passed."
  "2026-08-07T18:56:25.676Z",codex-jellyfin-api-20260807,Draft PR #55 opened from exact implementation head 1d01223 with working main-branch links to this plan and append-only history. Review will run only after the PM linkage commit is pushed so every bot evaluates one current head.
